## Reporting a vulnerability

Report suspected security vulnerabilities privately through
[GitHub's report form]({{REPO_URL}}/security/advisories/new). Include the affected version, the
potential impact, and enough detail to reproduce the problem. Keep vulnerability details out of
public issues and pull requests while the report is being assessed.

For ordinary bugs and questions, use the [public issue tracker]({{REPO_URL}}/issues). If you are
unsure whether a problem is security-sensitive, use the private route first.

